\bibglsnewentry{vasuka}%
{sort={bearded|premna|}}%
{bearded premna}%
{Premna barbata Wall. ($\leftarrow$ \emph{vasuhaṭṭa}), according to Cakrapāṇidatta.  See the discussion by \citet[362--363]{gvdb}, where other candidate species such as Osmanthus, Calotropis, and Trianthema are discussed. \citet[363]{gvdb} note that when \emph{vasuka} is mentioned with \emph{vasira}, two varieties of salt are often meant (see \emph{vasukavasirā}).  See also \cite[\#1299]{NK} who identifies it with Indigofera enneaphylla, Linn. (Birdsville Indigo), apparently without controversy}


